  was written as if 1rem = 16px, but Dawn sets 1rem = 10px, so that text
  rendered at about 60% of its intended size (9-12px). These rules bring
  body text to 16px+ and small labels to 12px+. Dawn's own text is untouched.
{%- endcomment -%}
